{
  "_comment": "Perks are per character and come only from the mod menu. category: style = the character's way of playing (no plain stat perks), supply = what you start with (item_on_start puts game_item into the inventory at the first arena; generic ones plus one per character), support = bad situations (low health, lethal hits), skin = a perk a skin grants through its starting_passive (never listed; most skins are builds, see characters.json), curse = route modifiers. A menu perk's 'build' adds into the run's build (characters.h ApplyPerkBuild: damage by weapon category, melee damage, health, heals, supplies, stack sizes, weapons never offered, drops as ammo for the gun in hand, items swapped on pickup, grabs broken). Not yet possible: move speed. Item ids: 0x0106 hand grenade, 0x0107 incendiary, 0x0108 flash, 0x0304 first aid spray, 0x0201 handgun ammo, 0x0102 M92F, 0x0104 Ithaca M37, 0x0113 MP5, 0x011A L.Hawk.",
